      "source": "wotc",
      "comment": "You may spend the two mana added by the last ability on the same ability or on two different abilities."
    },
    {
      "oracle_id": "508189e1-9cef-4f9c-8ff1-078c99a0f603",
      "published_at": "2023-11-10",
      "source": "wotc",
      "comment": "\"Land sources\" include any objects with the card type land. This means you could spend the mana to activate an ability of a land you control or a land card in your hand or graveyard, for example."
    },
    {
      "oracle_id": "b26cfeb0-7bbe-4d93-8eed-e832f175a80c",
      "published_at": "2025-06-06",
      "source": "wotc",
      "comment": "Town is a land type with no special meaning. It doesn't grant the land any intrinsic abilities. Other cards may care about which lands are Towns."
    },
